&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Experience team sits within SumUp&#39;s Operations function, focused on one clear mission: making AI-powered support genuinely useful for the millions of small businesses that rely on SumUp every day. The team owns the conversation design, content quality, and performance of SumUp&#39;s AI Assistant — working at the intersection of customer experience, data, and product thinking. This role is the dedicated leader the team has been built for: someone who can set the strategic direction, raise the bar on performance, and develop a talented group of analysts doing meaningful, pioneering work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎬 Get a feel for where you&#39;ll be working: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and lead the strategic direction of AI-assisted customer support, setting the roadmap for conversation design, content quality, and self-service performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the AI Assistant&#39;s core performance metrics — resolution rates, escalation rates, save rates, and customer satisfaction — and drive measurable improvements across all of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a Quality Assurance framework for AI customer support, ensuring answers are accurate, clear, and aligned with SumUp&#39;s support standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and grow a team of seven analysts across conversation design, QA, and content — bringing structure, direction, and coaching to a newly formed function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Engineering, and Operations leads to align priorities, remove blockers, and translate business goals into cross-functional improvement plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
