&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a matrix environment, influencing Product, Engineering, and Operations stakeholders without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and fast-moving priorities, with a structured approach to problem-solving and a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
