&lt;p data-start=&quot;268&quot; data-end=&quot;407&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;268&quot; data-end=&quot;279&quot;&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;291&quot;&gt;€42,108&lt;/strong&gt; + &lt;strong data-start=&quot;294&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Mobility Allowance €500/month&lt;/strong&gt; + &lt;strong data-start=&quot;330&quot; data-end=&quot;356&quot;&gt;Incidentals €160/month&lt;/strong&gt; + &lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;388&quot;&gt;Phone Allowance €20/month&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;390&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;OTE €78,000+&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;High performers can exceed €100K+++&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;199339u&quot; data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;SumUp is looking for an experienced, field-based new business hunter to drive net new revenue through the sale of payments and full POS solutions into Irish SMBs, with a strong focus on hospitality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;835&quot;&gt;This role suits someone who can confidently prospect, uncover customer needs, deliver high-quality demos, and build a clear value case, all within a short sales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own your territory end-to-end, including self-generation, pipeline management, pricing, and closing. This is a role for someone with a strong sense of ownership and an entrepreneurial mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;mnzuv&quot; data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1061&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yyqa8&quot; data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;Generate new business through proactive field prospecting, cold outreach and local networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aw4rwu&quot; data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Sell SumUp&#39;s payments and POS solutions to SMB merchants, particularly within the hospitality sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wr7v3f&quot; data-start=&quot;1264&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Target established businesses (typically €25k+ monthly TPV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2olzll&quot; data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1433&quot;&gt;Run structured discovery conversations to understand how a business operates and identify opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wlnybn&quot; data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Deliver tailored product demonstrations across POS and payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dwx1l&quot; data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1579&quot;&gt;Lead pricing discussions and close using a consultative, value-led approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4atjhk&quot; data-start=&quot;1580&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Manage your pipeline, forecasting and activity in line with SumUp standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tmusvu&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;Build and leverage referrals from your merchant base and local network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1matbvv&quot; data-start=&quot;1734&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;2312&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l0yd1&quot; data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Minimum &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;2 years&#39;&lt;/strong&gt; proven B2B new business field sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ffhysy&quot; data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Your most recent role must have been primarily focused on new business acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wyy2f8&quot; data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1991&quot;&gt;Proven experience selling into SMB customers within a defined territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16sqzqq&quot; data-start=&quot;1992&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Experience selling merchant services, payments and/or POS solutions is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mzol9n&quot; data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2172&quot;&gt;Other technical or hospitality-related field sales backgrounds will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r2rg75&quot; data-start=&quot;2173&quot; data-end=&quot;2235&quot;&gt;A genuine self-starter with excellent organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19xggo8&quot; data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2312&quot;&gt;Full Irish driving licence (or full licence valid for working in Ireland).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;j07wr0&quot; data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Successful&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2348&quot; data-end=&quot;2718&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rohlli&quot; data-start=&quot;2348&quot; data-end=&quot;2465&quot;&gt;A true &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;hunter mindset&lt;/strong&gt; who enjoys prospecting, winning new business and building a territory from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eog8ec&quot; data-start=&quot;2466&quot; data-end=&quot;2541&quot;&gt;Strong commercial judgement with confidence discussing value and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pph1ha&quot; data-start=&quot;2542&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;High levels of activity whilst maintaining quality conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vif5qk&quot; data-start=&quot;2610&quot; data-end=&quot;2718&quot;&gt;The ability to move merchants from simple card payment solutions to a complete POS and business ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;uuj9e&quot; data-start=&quot;2720&quot; data-end=&quot;2765&quot;&gt;Ready to Take Ownership of Your Territory?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2767&quot; data-end=&quot;2948&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re looking to build a successful career with one of Europe&#39;s leading fintech companies while maximising your earning potential, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2902&quot; data-end=&quot;2948&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;apply today and let&#39;s have a conversation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SumUp Limited is our Central Bank of Ireland regulated electronic money institution, and it&#39;s entering a defining period of its growth. As Chief Operating Officer, you&#39;ll take overall accountability for the firm&#39;s internal operations, working alongside the SumUp executive team to make sure our governance, resilience, and regulatory standards match the scale of what we&#39;re building. This is a rare chance to shape the operating backbone of a regulated fintech from a senior, board level seat, at a moment when the firm is actively strengthening its structure and controls to support future growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and deliver SumUp Limited&#39;s operational strategy in partnership with the senior leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the firm&#39;s outsourcing strategy, including governance, oversight, risk assessment, and the outsourcing register&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain regulatory accountability documents, including the Statement of Responsibilities and the Management Responsibility Map under SEAR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior point of contact for the Central Bank of Ireland, supporting inspections and regulatory engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own operational resilience, business continuity, and wind down planning, including testing and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular operational reporting to the CEO, board, and Central Bank of Ireland on performance, risk, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant senior leadership experience in an operations role within a Central Bank of Ireland regulated financial services firm or e-money institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of the Individual Accountability Framework, SEAR, and Fitness and Probity requirements, gained through holding or supporting a PCF role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing large, complex operational organisations across multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning outsourcing governance, operational resilience frameworks, and regulatory compliance programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deliver operational transformation and efficiency at scale while managing regulator relationships credibly and transparently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our homely, Dublin hub just steps from Harcourt Street Luas and charming Iveagh Gardens. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: 25 days paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Well-being support: health insurance for you and your family, and subsidised gym membership when you stay active&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚲 Easy commute perks: participate in the Bike-to-Work or TaxSaver Commuter Ticket scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial growth: retirement savings match—SumUp tops your contributions up to 5%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Lending Collections Agent&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s lending products now run across nine European markets, and every new market means more merchants who need support if a cash advance repayment falls behind. You&#39;ll join the Servicing and Collections team in Berlin, working directly with merchants to resolve overdue payments, agree realistic repayment plans, and keep small businesses trading rather than losing them. This is hands on work with a real result: every call you make protects a merchant&#39;s business and SumUp&#39;s lending book, and your feedback will help shape how the team&#39;s processes evolve as the product keeps growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle merchant queries relating to lending servicing and collections across phone, email and other channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up proactively on overdue Cash Advance repayments and agree workable repayment plans with merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet individual quality and productivity targets on a monthly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the team&#39;s overall collections targets across SumUp&#39;s European lending markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build collections expertise on the job, working closely with a team lead and manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot recurring issues and suggest improvements to collections processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer support or phone based customer service role, ideally handling sensitive conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Italian at a business level, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer literacy and comfort picking up new tools and systems quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to stay calm, empathetic and professional during difficult or emotionally charged conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working towards individual and team targets in a structured, metrics driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; experience in collections, knowledge of compliance and risk procedures, Salesforce experience, or fluency in French, Dutch or German.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1 month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
