&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Support Agent on the SumUp Consumer team, you&#39;ll be the direct link between SumUp and our consumers, delivering exceptional support and creating positive customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a brand-new team supporting a fast-growing product, giving you the unique opportunity to help define what outstanding consumer support looks like at SumUp. As one of the founding members of the team, you&#39;ll play a key role in shaping processes, influencing the customer experience, and contributing to the growth of a team that&#39;s set to expand rapidly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
