&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software &amp;amp; Tool Proficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable working in modern digital environments. Hands-on experience with at least one CS tool (Zendesk, Salesforce, Intercom, Freshdesk, or similar) and standard productivity tools (Slack, Google Suite). Ability to learn new tools quickly is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
