&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hand over opportunities with clear, well-documented notes so the sales team has everything they need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep your CRM accurate and up to date across activity, pipeline and progress&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work towards — and ideally beat — your weekly and monthly activity and appointment targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share what&#39;s working with the wider team and learn from other SDRs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your sales skills through regular coaching, call reviews and team sessions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You speak &lt;strong&gt;Dutch fluently or at native level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a good working level of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; for communication with our international team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a confident communicator and comfortable speaking with new people every day&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t mind picking up the phone — outbound sales is a big part of the role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re target-driven and take ownership of your own performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re organised, consistent and understand that good sales results come from doing the basics well every day&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re coachable, open to feedback and genuinely interested in improving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy working in a fast-moving, international environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous sales experience is useful, but &lt;strong&gt;attitude, communication skills and willingness to learn matter just as much&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
