&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start strong. You’ll earn 75% of SumUp’s net revenue in your first year, setting you up for quick wins and solid income from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
