&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;This opportunity is available in - Carlow, Kilkenny &amp;amp; Laois.&lt;/p&gt;
