&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-x0oz0e e173j6r83&quot;&gt;Note: This is a 100% commission-only, self-employed role. There is no basic salary. Your financial outcome is entirely a reflection of your drive, discipline, and sales competence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
