&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;324&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;324&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring: Field Sales Territory Manager – Calabria! 🇮🇹&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;326&quot; data-end=&quot;371&quot;&gt;📍 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Location: Cosenza - Calabria (Field based)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;764&quot;&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re a global fintech company on a mission to help small businesses thrive. Operating in 30+ markets, we empower local entrepreneurs with simple, accessible, and reliable payment solutions — from card readers to business accounts, POS systems, and online stores. With more than 4 million merchants worldwide, we’re building a world where anyone can run a business with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;766&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;828&quot;&gt;hands-on Field Sales Territory Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead, inspire, and scale our Field Sales operations across Calabria. If you’re a natural leader, thrive on driving results, and love being out in the field with your team, this is the perfect opportunity to make a big impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;🔥 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Lead from the front:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;Be active in the field, accompanying your team on visits, supporting live sales situations, and driving results through direct engagement with merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Build and grow the region:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Develop and execute a territory strategy — mapping high-potential areas, identifying target segments, and expanding SumUp’s presence across Calabria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;Coach and develop talent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1484&quot;&gt;Manage, train, and support a team of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;around 10 Field Sales Representatives&lt;/strong&gt; operating across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Drive performance excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1626&quot; data-end=&quot;1629&quot;&gt;Set clear targets, monitor KPIs, and run weekly alignment meetings to ensure strong execution and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1798&quot;&gt;Strengthen cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1798&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Work closely with central teams on commission structures, incentives, and market insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1922&quot;&gt;Champion the SumUp brand:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Ensure high-quality sales practices and a consistent brand presence in every city and customer interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;🧠 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2045&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2787&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;Has solid experience in Field Sales, ideally in SaaS, digital products, or consultative selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2182&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;Has previously managed field sales teams and is confident leading 10+ representatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2275&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;Is highly results-driven and thrives in a fast-paced, target-focused environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2359&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2361&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Communicates clearly, coaches effectively, and leads by example both in the office and on the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2466&quot; data-end=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;Uses data to inform decisions and improve team performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2528&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2530&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Knows the Calabrian business landscape and is comfortable traveling daily across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2678&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2625&quot; data-end=&quot;2678&quot;&gt;Is proactive, problem-solving, and growth-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2679&quot; data-end=&quot;2787&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2681&quot; data-end=&quot;2787&quot;&gt;Speaks fluent&lt;strong&gt; Italian and English&lt;/strong&gt;, as internal communication and the recruitment process will be conducted in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2794&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;🎁 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2800&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2819&quot; data-end=&quot;3211&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2819&quot; data-end=&quot;2898&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2821&quot; data-end=&quot;2898&quot;&gt;A key leadership role shaping SumUp’s growth and market presence in Calabria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2899&quot; data-end=&quot;2990&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2901&quot; data-end=&quot;2990&quot;&gt;Autonomy to manage your territory and your team, with strong support from central teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2991&quot; data-end=&quot;3067&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2993&quot; data-end=&quot;3067&quot;&gt;A dynamic and innovative environment focused on learning and development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3068&quot; data-end=&quot;3130&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3070&quot; data-end=&quot;3130&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3131&quot; data-end=&quot;3211&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3133&quot; data-end=&quot;3211&quot;&gt;Strong career progression opportunities within a fast-growing global company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3218&quot; data-end=&quot;3378&quot;&gt;If you’re passionate about empowering small businesses and ready to lead a high-performing field team, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3218&quot; data-end=&quot;3378&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your CV/resume in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;📍&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;London, office-first &lt;/strong&gt;| 🕐 &lt;strong&gt;12-month fixed-term contract (with possibility of extension)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Sales Training team is a group of highly engaged and commercially minded trainers, working across Europe to make sure every field sales representative has the knowledge, skills, and confidence to succeed from day one. In the UK, we&#39;re growing fast — and the quality of that growth matters just as much as the pace. This role sits at the heart of that ambition: you&#39;ll be the person who turns new hires into active, high-performing field reps, and helps existing reps keep raising the bar. If you&#39;re someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, takes ownership without being asked, and genuinely cares about the impact of great training, this is a role worth getting excited about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to shape how Field Sales Representatives are trained, supported, and activated across the UK — with a direct impact on their early success and on the growth of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver engaging onboarding for up to 60 new field sales representatives per month through a blend of live workshops and self-directed content, taking ownership of their readiness from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead role-play assessments and accreditations to evaluate sales readiness, provide constructive feedback, and ensure new hires are equipped to make their first sale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track activation rates and new joiner performance data to measure the commercial impact of training, identify gaps early and take action to improve outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the existing UK Field Sales Trainer and Training Team Lead to design and continuously improve programmes that drive sales volume, quality, and multi-product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Territory Managers, recruiters, and Sales Enablement to share insights on candidate readiness, onboarding engagement, and early performance— and use those insights to improve what comes next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent facilitation, coaching, and feedback skills, with the ability to engage people with different levels of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering live and virtual sales training, including role-play facilitation and accreditation sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect training initiatives directly to commercial outcomes such as activation rates, rep performance, and sales results, and take ownership of those numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and adapting training materials, including assessments and self-directed content, that hold up in a fast-moving, high-volume environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of digital learning platforms (LMS), sales tools, and blended learning approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid UK driving licence and comfort travelling across the South of the UK to deliver in-person training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Bankside location, in a culturally rich area that bridges deep history and modern living. This involves an office-first setup&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;FP&amp;amp;A Strategy Intern — Corporate FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berlin, Germany (office-first)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Corporate FP&amp;amp;A is SumUp&#39;s internal strategy and finance partner to business leaders— the team that turns data into the decisions that move the business. We build the forecasts, scenario models, and business cases behind capital allocation, reporting strategy, and investor relations. Think of us as an in-house consulting team with a finance lens. As our FP&amp;amp;A Strategy Intern, you&#39;ll own real analyses from day one and see your work shape decisions at the leadership level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong&gt;financial and strategic models&lt;/strong&gt; to evaluate capital allocation trade-offs, market-entry scenarios, and long-range business plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on internal data to surface &lt;strong&gt;risks, opportunities, and strategic insights&lt;/strong&gt; that inform executive decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional strategy projects&lt;/strong&gt; — pricing optimisation, revenue growth levers, unit-economics improvement, or cost-efficiency initiatives — and present recommendations to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop &lt;strong&gt;investment cases and business cases&lt;/strong&gt; for product launches, geographic expansion, and strategic initiatives, translating complex analysis into clear narratives for board-level reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and monitor &lt;strong&gt;KPIs, dashboards, and performance frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;, and contribute to the automation of analytical workflows using modern tools and scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You completed (or you&#39;re about to complete) a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Master&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in finance, economics, business, engineering, or a quantitative field from a top-tier university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in a &lt;strong&gt;structured, hypothesis-driven&lt;/strong&gt; way — you can take an ambiguous strategic question, break it into a clear issue tree, and drive to a data-backed recommendation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve had a first taste of &lt;strong&gt;high-impact problem-solving&lt;/strong&gt; through internships in &lt;strong&gt;strategy consulting, corporate strategy, venture capital, growth-stage startups, or investment banking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a strong &lt;strong&gt;analytical modeller&lt;/strong&gt; — confident building scenario analyses and sensitivity models in Google Sheets or Excel, and you can (or want to learn to) automate workflows with Apps Script or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can &lt;strong&gt;tell a crisp, visual story&lt;/strong&gt; in slides — distilling complex analysis into clear, executive-ready narratives in Google Slides or PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid &lt;strong&gt;financial acumen&lt;/strong&gt; — you understand P&amp;amp;L drivers, unit economics, and how business performance flows through the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on &lt;strong&gt;real strategic questions&lt;/strong&gt; alongside SumUp&#39;s finance leadership — your analysis will feed decisions affecting 4 million+ merchants across 37 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;steep learning curve&lt;/strong&gt; with direct mentorship from senior FP&amp;amp;A managers who&#39;ve come from consulting and banking backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role that blends &lt;strong&gt;strategy, finance, and data&lt;/strong&gt; — the kind of experience that accelerates careers in corporate strategy, investing, or operating roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extras like an Urban Sports Club subsidy and subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A truly global, multicultural team of 3,000+ SumUppers from 90+ nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe with simple, affordable tools that help them thrive. Over 4 million businesses across 37 markets rely on SumUp to manage payments, finance, and customer relationships. SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and does not make hiring decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion, ethnic or national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SumUp gives small businesses the tools they need to get paid, manage their money, and grow - today, over 4 million merchants across 37 markets worldwide rely on SumUp to do exactly that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Bank Web squad&lt;/strong&gt; sits within SumUp&#39;s&lt;strong&gt; Bank&lt;/strong&gt; domain and owns the web experience across our banking surfaces - from the business account dashboard that merchants use daily, to the back-office tooling that powers the support teams behind them. The team has a clear mission: make Bank Web a genuinely first-class platform, on par with our mobile applications in quality, reliability, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining now means being part of a team that’s at a key growth point - modernization work, growing scope across markets, and making architectural decisions that will shape how millions of merchants experience SumUp&#39;s banking products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉&lt;a class=&quot;_2b265d07 eed60403 _268c69ed _85fd6935 _745f0365&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu%2Ebe%2Fgqtjm5NUXs0%3Fsi%3Dt7YARvQWQHHidD_z&amp;amp;urlhash=5pT4&amp;amp;mt=1EPYGOSkRjDRXJ7wuFUOyOpVKlYinrRMMWYO881Vk3F7LDNa_TV0TJZRi3NLtcZu0lv7bJ2uYK9NWZ55lTpL5gAM&amp;amp;isSdui=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Take a look at our Sofia office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_7e25325f _33487e32 _4f3c78e9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features end-to-end across our web banking surfaces - from scoping and component implementation through testing, observability, and production maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the full stack - including defining API contracts, working with backend proxies, and integrating with the services that power our banking platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to modernisation efforts, including architectural improvements, component refactoring, and stack migrations that reduce technical debt and accelerate future delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review peers&#39; pull requests with attention to UI consistency, accessibility, and frontend best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in production support and incident reviews, helping to strengthen the squad&#39;s operational resilience across its web domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_7e25325f _33487e32 _4f3c78e9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with React, TypeScript, with a track record of delivering production-ready features end-to-end -not just isolated UI components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine full-stack capability: Experience defining API contracts, working with backend proxies, and owning integrations, not just consuming them; backend experience in Node, Kotlin, Java, or Golang is valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of frontend architecture, component design patterns, state management, and how frontend applications connect to backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing and maintaining frontend tests (unit, integration, snapshot, end-to-end) and a genuine care for code quality and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating a complex, multi-stack codebase. React and TypeScript are core to this role, while our broader ecosystem also includes Node.js, Kotlin, Java, Go, Angular, AWS and Kafka. Prior experience with all of these is not required, but familiarity with most of them is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about complex domains - banking products have intricate user flows and edge cases, and you enjoy digging into them to find the right solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD practices and getting changes safely to production; exposure to AI tooling to augment engineering workflows is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_7e25325f _33487e32 _4f3c78e9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our modern Sofia office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 and 10 paid days of educational leave which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: 25 days of paid leave, plus one extra day per year of service (up to 35), along with public holidays and special leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏥 Peace of mind: additional health insurance and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Stay active: on-site yoga and a co-sponsored Multisport card offering access to hundreds of sports facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍽️ Meal support: benefit from a tax-free food voucher program plus flexibility via our Re:Benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚌 Easy commute: free shuttle buses connecting directly to Joliot-Curie metro station&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
