&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head of SDR, Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU GTM | Milan, Italy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;€88,160 to €117,547 base salary + commissions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s field sales engine is growing fast across Europe, and the SDR function is at the heart of that growth. Our Sales Development Representatives generate qualified pipelines for high-performing field reps across the UK, France, Germany, and Italy — and we&#39;re now building the leadership infrastructure to take this to the next level. This is a rare opportunity to build and lead a European SDR organisation from the ground up: setting the strategy, writing the playbook, and scaling a team that will directly shape how SumUp wins new business at scale. You&#39;ll report into senior European Sales leadership and work closely with the Outbound Growth Lead and RevOps to build something that&#39;s already proving its value — and needs the right leader to realise its full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the SDR function, scaling to 80+ team members based in Barcelona and Milan who operate with a European scope — supporting the UK, Italy, Germany, France, and new markets expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement a standard operating playbook — covering commission plans, tooling, daily rituals, and performance rituals — so teams can perform consistently and at a high level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day performance of the SDR function, tracking qualified appointments set and deals closed, and delivering regular updates to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with RevOps, Outbound Growth Lead, and country Sales Heads to remove hiring bottlenecks, improve data and lead quality, and integrate AI-driven tools to improve SDR productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop SDR talent into future sales roles, building a pipeline of outbound reps and account executives from within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading an SDR or outbound sales function at scale, with direct people management of large teams across multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building sales teams or SDR functions from scratch, including establishing processes, playbooks, and performance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and strategic thinking skills, with the ability to translate data into clear decisions and communicate them with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-moving, evolving environment where structures are still being built and priorities can shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate with clarity and conviction across all levels — whether coaching a team, aligning with peers, or presenting to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our inspiring Milan location. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 22 days of annual paid leave, 32 hours of Ex Festivita (Personal Hours), plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: corporate pension contributions that support your long-term future&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;❤️ Well-being support: access our mental health Employee Assistance Programme for guidance and care when you need it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
