&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;💼 Inbound Account Executive – Netherlands (On-Site – London)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;305&quot;&gt;Ready to grow your sales career in one of the world’s leading fintech scale-ups — while owning the Dutch market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;307&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;Join our &lt;strong data-start=&quot;316&quot; data-end=&quot;348&quot;&gt;Inbound Sales Team in London&lt;/strong&gt;, where you’ll turn warm leads into happy customers and help small businesses across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;452&quot;&gt;the Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt; succeed with SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;474&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;At SumUp, we believe small merchants are the heart of the economy. That’s why we build intuitive, affordable tools that make getting paid simple. With over 4 million businesses using SumUp across 30+ countries, we’re shaping the future of payments — and we want you on the journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;As an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;762&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;Inbound Account Executive – Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work with inbound leads from the Dutch market, guiding small and medium-sized businesses through their first steps with SumUp and helping them choose the right solutions for their needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1014&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;🎯 What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1149&quot;&gt;💬 Engage with inbound leads generated by our marketing team in the Netherlands — qualify, consult, and convert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;📞 Connect with small and medium-sized businesses via phone and email, building trust in both English and Dutch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1369&quot;&gt;🎤 Deliver tailored product demos and clearly explain how SumUp solves real-world business challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1371&quot; data-end=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;📈 Manage your pipeline in Salesforce, ensuring structured follow-ups and efficient lead conversion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;📊 Track your performance, report on results, and stay aligned with team and regional targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;🤝 Collaborate with the wider European sales team to share insights about the Dutch market and customer trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;👀 You’ll Be a Great Fit If You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1810&quot;&gt;✔ Speak &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1734&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Dutch fluently (C2/native level)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1775&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;English at professional level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;✔ Have experience in a phone-based or customer-facing role (sales, support, retail, hospitality, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;✔ Feel confident engaging business owners and decision-makers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;✔ Are curious about fintech and motivated to understand the Dutch SMB landscape&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2066&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;✔ Thrive in a fast-paced, performance-driven environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2224&quot;&gt;✔ Bring a proactive, team-first attitude and enjoy contributing to a collaborative sales culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2339&quot;&gt;Bonus points for experience with payments, POS/EPOS software, SaaS, or Excel — but we’ll teach you what you need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2346&quot; data-end=&quot;2366&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2346&quot; data-end=&quot;2366&quot;&gt;🌟 Why Join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2368&quot; data-end=&quot;2466&quot;&gt;💸 &lt;strong&gt;Competitive base salary + uncapped commission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2416&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;Your earning potential grows with your success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2468&quot; data-end=&quot;2580&quot;&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Own a Key European Market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2496&quot; data-end=&quot;2499&quot;&gt;Develop commercial expertise while managing relationships across the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2582&quot; data-end=&quot;2713&quot;&gt;🏢 &lt;strong&gt;Office-first Setup in Central London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2621&quot; data-end=&quot;2624&quot;&gt;Work face-to-face with your team and be part of a growing, high-energy sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2715&quot; data-end=&quot;2833&quot;&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;€2,000 Annual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2747&quot; data-end=&quot;2750&quot;&gt;Invest in your professional development through courses, events, or certifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2835&quot; data-end=&quot;2926&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;strong&gt;30-Day Paid Sabbatical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2860&quot; data-end=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;After 3 years with us, take a fully paid month off to recharge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2928&quot; data-end=&quot;3034&quot;&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;Diverse &amp;amp; Inclusive Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2958&quot; data-end=&quot;2961&quot;&gt;Be part of an international team where different perspectives are valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3036&quot; data-end=&quot;3106&quot;&gt;💸 &lt;strong&gt;Referral Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3053&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;Know someone amazing? Refer them and get rewarded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3113&quot; data-end=&quot;3249&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This isn’t just a sales role&lt;/strong&gt; — it’s your opportunity to build commercial expertise in fintech while owning an important European market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3251&quot; data-end=&quot;3404&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you’re excited about fintech, love working with people, and want to grow your career in an international environment, apply now and join us in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we create powerful, easy-to-use financial solutions to help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;¿Te apasionan las ventas? ¿Eres experto cerrando leads? ¡En SumUp te estamos buscando!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos encontramos en busca de nuestros nuevos &lt;strong&gt;Ejecutiva/os de Ventas Inbound&lt;/strong&gt;, quienes serán el motor de crecimiento desde nuestras oficinas, gestionando leads tibios para expandir SumUp en Chile. Si tienes una comunicación de alto impacto, hambre de resultados y te mueve la tecnología, esta es tu oportunidad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu propósito&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Convertirte en el socio estratégico de miles de comercios a través de canales remotos. Tu misión es contactar, calificar y cerrar acuerdos con leads tibios, transformando el interés inicial en una relación comercial sólida y recurrente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lo que buscamos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Al menos 2 años de experiencia en ventas consultivas&lt;/strong&gt; modalidad Inbound Sales, Televenta, telemarketing o gestión de canales digitales (Fintech, SaaS, Seguros o Banca).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comunicación de alto impacto:&lt;/strong&gt; Capacidad de generar cierres de negocios a través del teléfono y videollamadas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dominio experto de CRM (Salesforce):&lt;/strong&gt; Gestión impecable del pipeline y seguimiento de leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentalidad Data-Driven:&lt;/strong&gt; Comodidad trabajando con métricas de conversión, tiempos de respuesta (SLA) y volumen de llamadas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agilidad Digital:&lt;/strong&gt; Manejo fluido de herramientas de comunicación y cierre de ventas a distancia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disponibilidad para trabajar 100% presencial.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un día en tu vida:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestión de Leads:&lt;/strong&gt; Serás el primero en contactar a los interesados en SumUp, convirtiendo leads tibios en cierres efectivos mediante llamadas y presentaciones virtuales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Venta Consultiva Remota:&lt;/strong&gt; Realizarás demostraciones de nuestro ecosistema de pagos (POS y soluciones digitales) adaptándolas a las necesidades específicas de cada rubro (cafeterías, retail, servicios).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimización del Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Priorizarás tu embudo de ventas en el CRM para asegurar que ningún prospecto se enfríe, manteniendo una cadencia de contacto eficiente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cierre y Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; No solo cierras la venta; aseguras que el cliente entienda cómo activar su equipo y comenzar a vender, garantizando una excelente primera experiencia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lo que obtendrás&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance Vida/Trabajo:&lt;/strong&gt; 20 días de vacaciones anuales (15 legales + 5 extra).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break for Me:&lt;/strong&gt; Un mes de vacaciones pagadas al cumplir 3 años.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bienestar Integral:&lt;/strong&gt; Seguro complementario (Salud, Vida, Dental, Catastrófico) y apoyo en Salud Mental.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crecimiento:&lt;/strong&gt; Acceso gratuito a plataforma de idiomas y programas de formación interna.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonos por Talento:&lt;/strong&gt; Programa de referidos&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comodidad:&lt;/strong&gt; Estacionamiento de bicicletas, cultura horizontal y feedback constante.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inbound Sales Team Lead – UK + New Markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK Inbound Sales team is the first point of contact for merchants who&#39;ve already shown interest in SumUp and that warm intent is a real advantage. The team works quickly to qualify, engage, and convert leads into long-term customers by matching the right SumUp solutions to each merchant&#39;s needs. This is a pivotal moment for the team: we&#39;re scaling into new European markets, and this role sits right at the centre of that growth. As Team Lead, you&#39;ll shape how we sell, how we coach, and how we scale, with direct influence over team performance, hiring, and the way we build out new markets from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Account Executives, running regular one-to-ones, performance reviews, and team sessions to build a high-performing, motivated sales culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyse key sales metrics, including lead-to-SQL and SQL-to-deal conversion rates,sing CRM data to spot trends and implement targeted improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine sales processes, playbooks, and best practices that improve efficiency and closing rates across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the bridge between sales, marketing, and other internal teams, feeding back on lead quality and helping align efforts across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the hiring and onboarding of new Account Executives as we scale into new markets, with a goal of growing the team to six&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a closing sales role, with a strong track record of hitting and exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor, motivate, and develop others — whether formally or informally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and comfort working with CRM tools (such as Salesforce) to make data-informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance hands-on selling with team management in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and adaptability when navigating change, new markets, or shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our London Bridge Office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate with SumUp: Join Our Independent Sales Agent Team!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is expanding rapidly in the US—and we want you to be part of our success story! We have a contractor-based sales channel and are looking for high-performing sales professionals to join us as Independent Sales Agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Commissions:&lt;/strong&gt; Earn as much as you want—your success drives your rewards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Exclusive Agreements:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexibility to work with other brands; you’re in control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with SumUp, a global leader in payment solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Product:&lt;/strong&gt; Sell innovative, easy-to-use payment technology trusted by millions worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong existing networks in merchant/payment services &lt;/strong&gt;(think credit card processing, Point of Sale, Loyalty, Invoicing, and Kiosks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on merchant satisfaction and relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why SumUp?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-growing presence in the US market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supportive team&lt;/strong&gt; and proven sales resources (Regional Support Leads and US based support center)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;4 million merchants&lt;/span&gt; use SumUp&lt;/strong&gt; globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SumUp has &lt;strong&gt;3,000+ employees&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with 26 offices&amp;nbsp;across &lt;strong&gt;36 global markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized by CNBC as one of the &lt;strong&gt;World’s Top FinTech Companies in 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to accelerate your earnings and grow with us?&lt;/strong&gt; Business owners are at the heart of SumUp&#39;s focus, so we create powerful, easy-to-use financial solutions to help them run and grow their business. Contact us today to become a SumUp Independent Sales Agent!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#SumUpUSA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As an iOS Engineer on the Design System team, you&#39;ll translate SumUp&#39;s design language into a reusable, easy-to-use library of UI components and experience patterns — empowering product teams to build cohesive, accessible user experiences at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design System team works hand-in-hand with the Mobile Platform team to set standards and provide guidance across all product teams at SumUp. As we expand our ecosystem of merchant and consumer-facing products, this role offers a rare opportunity to shape the foundation that helps developers build faster and ship higher-quality experiences to millions of users worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the core experience for both users and developers interacting with SumUp&#39;s iOS ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product and design teams to build components that are maintainable, consistent, and beautiful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed accessibility best practices into every component — from content descriptions and touch target sizing to color contrast and dynamic type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on technical guidance to product teams to deliver on company priorities, including the upcoming brand refresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code contributions, enforce design system conventions, and mentor engineers on best practices for reusable UI development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the migration of legacy UIKit-based components to SwiftUI while maintaining system stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and address technical debt to uphold a high bar for engineering excellence and codebase health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a great fit for this role if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 3+ years of professional iOS development experience, ideally on large-scale or consumer-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in Swift, with deep hands-on knowledge of both SwiftUI and UIKit — and a clear view on when and how to use each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience building or contributing to a design system, component library, or shared UI framework, and understand what it takes to make components truly reusable and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in crafting accessible user experiences — you know your way around VoiceOver, dynamic type, color contrast, and touch target standards, and treat accessibility as a first-class concern, not an afterthought&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong grasp of testing best practices for UI components, including unit tests, snapshot tests, and UI automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable reviewing code and mentoring peers — you enjoy sharing knowledge, giving constructive feedback, and raising the bar for the whole team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated and structured in your working style — you manage your own priorities, communicate clearly in English, and thrive in a cross-functional, collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay genuinely curious about the iOS ecosystem — you follow Apple&#39;s releases closely, experiment with new APIs, and are excited to bring fresh ideas back to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which you can be used to attend conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we&#39;re creating tools that help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
