&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review and process verification cases for new and existing merchants, ensuring their onboarding is completed accurately and on time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meet daily case targets while maintaining a high standard of quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with senior agents and quality assurance colleagues to learn the ropes and handle cases with growing confidence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate internal tools and databases to gather and validate merchant information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flag any unusual patterns or issues to the relevant team leads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
