&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a territory-based sales pipeline by prospecting, canvassing, and developing relationships with local businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full sales cycle from cold outreach and door-to-door canvassing through to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research your territory to work smarter, identify the right opportunities, and prioritise your time effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our CRM to track activity, manage your pipeline, and keep communication sharp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SumUp&#39;s payment and loyalty solutions in a way that genuinely helps merchants grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great if the following describes you…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in sales, whether in retail, hospitality, B2B, or SaaS — we care more about your drive than your exact background or tenure in sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working independently in a field-based, territory-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to connect with people quickly, listen and tailor your approach to each merchants needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable access to transportation to cover your assigned territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of being self-motivated, resilient, and hungry to grow — even if you&#39;re still early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, in a remote-first field role across the US&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: 22 days of paid vacation, plus an extra day each year up to 28 days, public holidays, quarterly Wellness Days, and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
