&lt;p data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot;&gt;At SumUp, our People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team makes sure every employee has a smooth experience throughout their journey with us — from their first day to their latest promotion, and everything in between.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;426&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;As SumUp has grown, so has our team in Spain: we&#39;ve scaled from around &lt;strong data-start=&quot;497&quot; data-end=&quot;530&quot;&gt;40 employees to more than 400&lt;/strong&gt; in just a few years, and we&#39;re looking for a curious and motivated Working Student to grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in HR, payroll, operations, or simply want to understand how people processes work in a fast-growing fintech, this is an opportunity to gain hands-on experience and make a real impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;mn76sy&quot; data-start=&quot;852&quot; data-end=&quot;872&quot;&gt;Why this role? 💡&lt;/h2&gt;
