&lt;h2&gt;About the team 🙌&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s SDR function is powering growth across Europe — and our Barcelona office is where a lot of the action is. We&#39;re looking for a Team Lead who&#39;s ready to step up, own it, and build something real. You&#39;ll lead a multilingual team of SDRs generating pipeline across multiple European markets, coaching them daily and creating the kind of team culture where people actually want to show up and perform. If you&#39;ve been a top SDR and you&#39;re ready for the next chapter — this is it. 👇&lt;/p&gt;
