&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Lead and coach a team of SDRs in Barcelona — drive performance across outbound activity, qualified appointments, and pipeline contribution across European markets&lt;/p&gt;
