&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SDR Team Lead&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU GTM | Cologne, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team 🙌&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s SDR function is one of the fastest-growing parts of our European sales engine — and we need a Team Lead in Cologne who&#39;s ready to own it. You&#39;ll be the person your team looks to every day: coaching, calling it out, keeping energy high, and driving results that actually move the needle. This isn&#39;t a seat-warmer role. You&#39;ll shape how your team operates, build habits that stick, and create a culture where people genuinely want to perform. If you&#39;ve been a top SDR and you&#39;re ready to lead — this is your moment. 👇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Lead and coach a team of SDRs in Cologne — drive performance across outbound activity, qualified appointments, and pipeline contribution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;☀️ Run daily rituals that actually matter — standups, call reviews, 1:1s — keeping the team sharp and motivated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📊 Track KPIs like a hawk — spot performance gaps early and act fast with the right support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 Partner with Sales Managers, RevOps, and the Outbound Growth Lead to sharpen lead quality, targeting, and sequencing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Onboard new SDRs and ramp them fast — build the habits that turn new hires into top performers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📝 Help build and improve outbound playbooks, cadences, and messaging — iterate quickly on what works&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 Develop your team&#39;s careers — identify high performers and create real pathways into full-cycle sales roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📢 Report on team performance to senior leadership with clarity — trends, blockers, opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve been a top-performing SDR or inside sales rep and you&#39;re ready to bring others up with you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve already built or managed a team before — you know what it takes and you&#39;re not starting from zero&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know what great outbound looks like — from prospecting and sequencing to objection handling — and you can teach it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a hands-on, energetic leader who brings the heat even on tough days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re analytical and decisive — you use data to diagnose issues and make clear calls&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You communicate with clarity whether you&#39;re coaching a rep live or briefing senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
