&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the Merchant Risk Intelligence team within SumUp’s Risk &amp;amp; Compliance tribe. We build systems that help protect SumUp and its merchants from fraud while supporting reliable, compliant business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines software engineering, machine learning, data science, product management and risk expertise. You will join a multidisciplinary group currently working across backend services, data products and AI-powered solutions. The team is growing its software engineering capabilities to develop Sentinel, our entity-level investigation and actioning framework, and to support broader risk and compliance use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring dedicated Golang expertise to the team while also contributing to Python-based services and AI-agent initiatives. We value pragmatic engineering, thoughtful collaboration and the ability to balance delivery speed with security, reliability and long-term maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
