&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain reliable distributed systems and backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers, data scientists, machine learning engineers, fraud strategy teams and operational stakeholders to turn complex problems into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
