&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Python projects, including AI-agent initiatives, as you build a broader understanding of the team’s systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, testing, monitoring and continuous improvement of production services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools thoughtfully to deliver meaningful features faster without compromising code quality, security or maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
