&lt;p&gt;Help develop and improve the Internal Audit team&#39;s methodology, templates and framework&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track regulatory developments and industry best practice in technology risk and compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
