&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning acquisition metrics, attribution, and cost-per-customer across a channel set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and executing multi-market campaigns with localisation across multiple languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently, influence across matrixed teams and agencies, and build from scratch in an early-stage environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
