&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;payments processing platform,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;consisting of other sub-platforms, has powered SumUp’s global business for more than 10 years now. It’s developed in Sofia by the Payments Tribe, composed of several teams (squads). Each squad is cross-functional, autonomous and co-located, working on its part of the platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;We are scaling and improving existing products, while developing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;new&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;ones - an exciting time to join. You would make an impact by improving and co-creating our existing and new&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;microservices architecture&lt;/strong&gt; platforms, solving scaling and new development challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;Scalability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-one-cjrz cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e1itouxg2&quot;&gt;high availability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;are among our focus areas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
