&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: 22 days of paid vacation, plus an extra day each year up to 28 days, public holidays, quarterly Wellness Days, and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health and life coverage: medical coverage via Cigna &amp;amp; Kaiser, plus life insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: 401(k) retirement scheme with SumUp matching (100% on first 1%, 50% on 2–6%)&lt;/p&gt;
