&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance and scalability of the systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop integration with external partners to enable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of a high-performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
