&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical fluency across platform and infrastructure-adjacent topics, comfortable going deep on build pipelines, platform architecture, and developer tooling with senior engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong visual and UX judgement, with experience leading customer research — from discovery interviews to usability testing — and giving clear, constructive feedback to design teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in high-growth tech, fintech, or consumer app businesses, with a solid understanding of the mobile app publishing ecosystem including App Store, Play Store, and release processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
