&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Partner – Field Sales (Dutch-speaking)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 London, office-first | People | 12-month fixed-term contract&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/uWNyTvZGeew?si=IiJBUDQe8yJpOFwq&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Check out our London office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Field Sales Talent Acquisition team is at the centre of SumUp&#39;s growth across Europe, responsible for building the sales force that puts SumUp&#39;s tools into the hands of small businesses at scale. We work at pace — managing high-volume hiring funnels across multiple markets, partnering closely with sales leaders, sourcers, and trainers to hit ambitious onboarding targets every month. This is a hands-on role with real ownership of a full recruitment funnel, where your work has a direct and visible impact on business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage the end-to-end recruitment funnel for Field Sales in Dutch-speaking markets — from sourcing and screening through to offer and onboarding&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct structured candidate screening calls and keep a strong pipeline moving to consistently hit monthly onboarding targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review funnel data regularly to identify drop-off points and adjust sourcing or outreach strategies to improve conversion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with sourcers and sales managers to align on territory needs, launch local campaigns, and keep job ads active and visible across platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share market insights with the wider team and contribute to knowledge-sharing that improves overall hiring performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing high-volume recruitment end-to-end, ideally in a fast-paced or sales-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong ability to engage and sell to candidates, with the follow-up discipline to drive pipeline to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable working with ATS tools (such as Greenhouse) and sourcing platforms, with solid outbound search skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in Dutch and English, with strong written and verbal communication in both languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A results-oriented mindset with the resilience and adaptability to thrive in a high-tempo, target-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
